{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The long-lost research world Glacialis has appeared out of nowhere and your trusted council sends you there to establish contact and bring back any findings on the corrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frozen Frontier brings the following new things to the base game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brand new story featuring frozen gnomes in hours of content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arctic world, posing unique cold-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely new quests to progress through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New items and creatures befitting colder climates. How about a snowshoe hare?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snowfall covering your garden. Mostly as a cozy treat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique temperature-based expansion mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rely more on keepers who have distinct jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New upgrades specific to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be accessed from your existing save file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements, of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most items and creatures will find their way back to your main world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421790?t=1744716969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421790?t=1744716969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421790/59e698dd0cd77b81c7da5ba5f9c226570fcf9668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744716969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421790/59e698dd0cd77b81c7da5ba5f9c226570fcf9668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744716969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloa